            "review_title": "Review at May De Ville Lakeside Restaurant",
            "review_text": "HolidaymakerfromHove\nBrighton and Hove, United Kingdom4738 contributions\n0\nBreakfast with a view………..\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe ate breakfast here every morning during our recent 5 night stay in Hanoi.\n\nThe restaurant is located on the 12th floor with amazing city and lake views.\n\nThe breakfast buffet was exceptional every day. The staff greeted us warmly every morning asking how we were and what our plans were for the coming day. The egg station, and in particular the freshly made eggs Benedict, was great.\n\nSo much choice, tasty food and a great team of staff make this restaurant a real gem.\n\nWe really looked forward to breakfast here.\n\nHighly recommended as is the hotel itself.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
