            "review_title": "Review at May De Ville Lakeside Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Georgina H\n9 contributions\n0\nQuality Breakfast, Lunch or Dinner with a View\nJul 2025 • Solo\nExcellent restaurant serving an extensive traditional Vietnamese or European style breakfast and a Lunch and dinner menu of both quality Vietnamese and European cuisine. I chose the Vietnamese menu and it was beautifully presented and tasty, with wonderful views from the 12th floor over the lake and Ha Noi City. Staff team is both professional and friendly, adding to the dining experience. I would definitely recommend this restaurant for both hotel guests and those wanting a quality meal with a view.\nRead more\nWritten July 17, 2025",
